        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO1 (patient-state-sensitive communication) is triggered by the doctor's explicit query for accessibility and the tailored advice on caregiver-executed 24-hour urine collection; the plan is integrated directly into the closure, avoiding blame or forced disclosure.",
