    {
      "citations": [],
      "explanation": "RC3 requires the doctor to actively link the retrieved key nephritis background (urine protein ++, RBC 245/µL, albumin 21.4 g/L, eGFR 94.6) to the plan. Although the doctor queries the workspace multiple times (lite_evt_00084, lite_evt_00077) and the system displays these findings, the trainee never explicitly integrates or cites these specific values in the patient-facing message when discussing follow-up. The doctor references general '尿常规、24小时尿蛋白定量、血肌酐、补体C3/C4和抗dsDNA抗体' without connecting to the actual abnormal labs seen in the workspace output. This constitutes a minor omission.",
